     "text": "… eunuchs he exiled. But on the other side he himself remained intoxicated with wine at all times. After al-Qahir the amirs selected Ahmad bin Muqtadir al-Radi billah as caliph. His accession took place in 322 AH. His era of government is 934 CE to 940 CE. His era too was an era of degeneration. The series of revolts continued. Harun bin Gharib revolted, but was killed at the hands of his own slave. Mardawij was killed at the hands of the Turks. The government of Ali bin Buyah was recognised.",
