     "text": "Whenever they got an opportunity they kept attacking the border regions. When the condition of the caliphs became weaker and the Daylamis came to power, they did not advance in the era of Mu'izz al-Dawlah. When civil war began among the Daylamis too, they spread destruction in the border regions and began attacks on al-Jazirah, Syria, Armenia and Azerbaijan. This series continued for years.",
