     "text": "… opposition between them increased. At last in 530 AH he was deposed, and his uncle Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Mustazhir al-Muqtafi li-amr Allah was made caliph. His age was forty years. He too was a brave, valiant and bold ruler. The important event of his era of government is the establishment of the Khwarazmi government. Its founder was Khwarazm Shah. This government was established in the province of Khwarazm. Khwarazm Shah defeated Sultan Sanjar in 536 AH. Sultan Mas'ud died in 547 AH. With his death the lamp of the Seljuq dynasty began to go out. His brother Sulayman Shah took possession of the throne.",
