     "text": "For worldly progress it is necessary that there be some clear purpose before man. When the Muslims entered Andalus, their basic purpose was to make the Tawhid of Allah Almighty and the Risalah of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, his family and companions) a part of society there, and to mould that society in the teachings of the Qur'an and Sunnah. It was to end the feudal and capitalist system, to deliver the subjects from absolute rulers, and to establish such a society in which the honour, life and property of every human being are safe. But when the Muslims strayed from their purpose, they suffered defeat at the hands of their rivals.",
