   "content": "<p>Exercise questions</p><p>1. Take a brief review of the era of government of the Nasrid dynasty.</p><p>2. What were the causes of the decline of the Islamic sultanate in Andalus?</p><p>3. Throw light on the administration of the sultanate of the Banu Umayyah in Andalus.</p><p>4. Fill in the blanks with the correct words:</p><p>a. Muhammad adopted the title of ______ in Granada.</p><p>b. The famous historian ______ recorded the events of this era.</p><p>c. Zaghal fought with considerable bravery but remained ______.</p><p>d. In 1690 CE ______ signed a law according to which all Muslims were expelled from Andalus.</p><p>e. In January 1492 CE ______ and ______ entered al-Hamra&#x27;.</p><p>f. The head of hijabah was called ______.</p><p>g. The middle part of the army was called ______.</p><p>h. The right part of the army was called ______ and the left part ______.</p>",
